msgstr "⟪k:0⟫真是的，⟪k:1⟫完全……⟪k:2⟫一片黑啊……"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0839D5A2_76A3_4479_9250_FA63C9F2229C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6fd2e518e9027a649897b8fb061163ef45a00367bea847a3a56d691db7717956
