msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There was a door at the end of a long corridor. I pulled it open, and a wisp of "
"bone-chilling air brushed past me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫终于，穿过长长的暗廊，⟪k:3⟫推开尽头的门扉——⟪k:4⟫刹那间，彻骨的寒气迎面拂来。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_48E48AA0_6569_4B21_A769_E3A46A9FC003
