msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was too dark to see anything, but I could feel something ⟪k:1⟫different⟪k:2⟫ present in "
"this area than the rest of the house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫明明门的对面黑暗如故，⟪k:1⟫却不禁让人觉得这个的空间与先前完全不同。"

