msgstr "⟪k:0⟫顶着刺骨的寒气，踏进这片不可思议的空间，突然间——⟪k:1⟫我眼角的余光闪过一道摇曳的光线。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0BC2FFE7_19E0_44DB_8429_50B92FACAC3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
