#: scenario5:scenario5_ABC7108B_5CEF_427A_85D9_E2261981A91B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1f731a1d326f7a576f13531661b0ae900ef74ce9bfe3f6aa68a7785c447fb48
